\uc0\u61623  TB and all airborne transmission based precautions (chickenpox, measles)\
Use\
a surgical mask not an N95 for clients.\
This\
helps protect Health care workers and other clients from respiratory secretions,\
and contain respiratory secretions\
The\
HCWs who transport the clients from a negative pressure room to another\
