\fs24 \cf0 \uc0\u61623  SIDS\
Sudden\
unexplained death of an infant age <1 year. Highest occurrence at 24\
months.\
Protective\
factors:\
Supine sleeping position\
Breast feeding\
Pacifier use during sleep\
Up to date vaccinations\
Appropriate clothing (sleep sack)\
Firm sleep surface\
Removal of loose items from bed\
Risk\
factors:\
Prone/side sleeping position\
Tobacco smoke exposure before/after birth or any drugs\
Premature birth/low birth weight\
Overheating during sleep\
Soft sleep surface\
Bumper pads, toys and loose pillows/blankets\
