\cf0 Clients\
with cirrhosis typically have hypokalemia due to hyperaldosteronism (as it is not\
metabolized by the damaged liver). It can also occur d/t diuretics used to treat fluid\
retention and ascites.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf7 Ileostomy\
Surgical\
procedure that creates an opening (stoma) in the abdominal wall that originated\
from the intestinal mucosa of the ileum.\
In\
